  "description": "Vision deep models are image data hungry, but image storage has become a bottleneck (e.g., LAION-5B images require 240 TB).\n              We propose a storage-efficient training method, <em>SeiT</em>, that utilizes only 1% of standard pixel storage without sacrificing accuracy."
